  description: '2 "Mayakashi" monsters

    You can only control 1 "Yuki-Onna, the
    Ice Mayakashi". While this card points to a Synchro Monster(s), your opponent''s
    monsters cannot target this card for attacks. If a Synchro Monster(s) in your
    possession is destroyed by battle or an opponent''s card effect while this card
    is on the field: You can target 1 face-up monster on the field; its ATK/DEF become
    half its current ATK/DEF until the end of this turn. You can only use this effect
    of "Yuki-Onna, the Ice Mayakashi" once per turn.'
